! mcp_bootstrap_p386.strap -- MCP printed page 386: the $EOJ program
! (PUNID 22$EOJ, card series ZA), YMOVXW .. the general error routine.
!
! docs/MCP_Mar63_250-445.pdf PDF p.136, read at 400 dpi (900 dpi for
! doubtful glyphs).  Header, READ:
! "TIME CLOCK 00054041  PUNID 22$EOJ  CARD ID ZA000224  DIST. OF 3/01
!  3/01  PAGE NUMBER 386"; the heading row's LOCATION field is 020174,
! line 1's word.
!
! >>> NOT SCOMD. <<<  This page is PUNID 22$EOJ, card series ZA, at
! 020174.00 -- a different overlay from SCOMD (234424+, series WA).
! No $EOJ page has landed; every $EOJ-local external below is a stand-in
! taken from THIS page's binary.  Resident symbols (S..., D..., Y... of
! pp.99-319) are copied from the landed decks.
!
! THE PAGE.  Contiguous from 020174.00 to 020232.40 (55 lines).
!   lines  1-31  YMOVXW .. ,SDRET (the JC4 return, WJC4G1/WJC4G/WJC4G2)
!   lines 32-36  remark banner: GENERAL ERROR ROUTINE - PRINTS DIAGNOSIS
!                OF ERROR AND RETURNS TO BEGINNING , SKIPPING DEJSCN IF
!                EOJ CARD WAS ENCOUNTERED.
!   lines 37-55  YBRLOG .. ,SDRET
!
! GLYPHS SETTLED OTHER THAN BY PLAIN INK:
!   * line 1 "XW,C,0,C,4": open rounds; 0 (binary 000000.00+ 100 000000
!     000000 -- value, count and refill all zero).
!   * line 1 YMCVXW, line 4 YMCJRP, line 42 YECJP, line 47 WMCVIQ: this
!     drum prints O open.  YMOVXW (used by lines 2, 5), WMOVIQ (used by
!     44, 45, closed O in line 45's "WMOVIQ"), YEOJP (the EOJ family:
!     YEOJS is landed p.274 and prints "YEOJS" closed on line 48).
!   * line 44 label "WJC4Q": at 900 dpi the last glyph has the diagonal
!     tail of WMOVIQ's Q on the same row and no inward bar of line 8's
!     G; and the line carries no flag, as a second WJC4G would.  Q.
!   * line 30 "BE,CMCP" / line 31 ",SCRET": D worn to C; DMCP (000040),
!     SDRET (000041), as lines 54-55 print them plainly.
!   * line 41 B,YRESTR prints Y plainly although line 48 defines WRESTR
!     at the same 020226.00; kept as printed with a stand-in.
!
! FLAGS: a "*" prints after the LOCATION of lines 4 (V+I,$11,15.),
! 20 (CM0000(BU,2),SSPFIX -- a 2-bit field on a (BU,1) symbol) and 47
! (XW,WBREAK+1.0,0,1,0).  Recorded, not explained.
!
! CARD SERIALS: ZA000224 .. ZA000277; ZA000262 prints on BOTH lines 39
! and 40 (900 dpi).

SCOMRG  SYN, (8)215001.0             ! landed p.103 label
SCORG   SYN(BU,1), SCOMRG+0.03       ! landed p.103 line 13; BB line 7 215001.03
SPINCL  SYN(BU,1), SCOMRG+.6         ! landed p.103 line 16; CM1111 line 19 215001.06
SSPFIX  SYN(BU,1), SCOMRG+.11        ! landed p.103 line 20; CM0000 line 20 215001.13
SJ1FUL  SYN(BU,1), SCOMRG.16         ! landed p.103 line 25; BZB line 26 215001.20
