YLOL1   SYN, (8)231426.0             ! not landed; as p.271; SV line 10 231426.35, CM1111 line 12 .31
YLOL2   SYN, (8)231426.40            ! not landed; as p.271; SC line 11 231426.75
YEDLL   SYN(N), (8)231430.0          ! landed p.274 line 17 DRZ(N),(11); SV line 22 231430.75
